idle-daemon (3.5.17-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replace convenience crates with in-tree implementations (idle-err,
    idle-log, TOML parsing, file watching, futures helper); harden the
    dlopen wrapper so dlclose-then-call is a compile error; fix env-var
    test races and a Landlock ruleset fd leak on error paths.

