idle-daemon (3.5.15-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Trust idle-cli in D-Bus control auth: after the cli repo split the
    CLI binary is /usr/bin/idle-cli, so control methods (preview, config,
    saver set) were rejected with AccessDenied for every caller.

